$ pace client add acme --currency EUR   # at 08:52
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the client `acme` (acme) in EUR.
pace took these defaults: name `acme` from the key, no rate and no rounding; `pace client edit acme` changes them.

----- stderr -----

$ pace project add webshop --client acme --role work   # at 08:53
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the project `webshop` (webshop) for the client `acme` in the role `work`, billable.
pace took these defaults: name `webshop` from the key and billable, as it has a client; `pace project edit webshop` changes them.

----- stderr -----

$ pace project add garden --role health   # at 08:54
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the project `garden` (garden) in the role `health`, not billable.
pace took these defaults: name `garden` from the key, no client and not billable, as it has no client; `pace project edit garden` changes them.

----- stderr -----

$ pace --project webshop begin Write offer --role health --not-billable   # at 09:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Began [ID-1] "Write offer" in the role Health at 09:00.
Project: webshop (from --project).

----- stderr -----

$ pace --project garden adjust --role health --not-billable   # at 09:10
success: true
exit_code: 0
